1
00:00:00,713 --> 00:00:02,383
(Leonard:)You'd think
that the Czech Republic

2
00:00:02,381 --> 00:00:03,911
(Sheldon(on screen):)would try to hold on
to what it had,

3
00:00:03,916 --> 00:00:05,886
(Sheldon(on screen):)given that it's not as young
as it used to be.

4
00:00:05,884 --> 00:00:07,854
(Sheldon(on screen):)And I don't see
any other countries

5
00:00:07,853 --> 00:00:10,953
(Sheldon(on screen):)lining up to invade
its southern borders.

6
00:00:10,956 --> 00:00:13,126
(Amy:)I'm gonna kill him.

7
00:00:14,226 --> 00:00:15,796
(Sheldon:)But enough
about the Czech Republic.

8
00:00:15,794 --> 00:00:18,464
(Sheldon:)Let's talk about the time
Moldova made Romania

9
00:00:18,464 --> 00:00:21,334
(Sheldon:)a birthday cake
and Romania said it tasted good

10
00:00:21,333 --> 00:00:22,603
(Sheldon:)even though it didn't.

11
00:00:22,601 --> 00:00:24,371
(Sheldon:)And yet Romania gets dumped.

12
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:26,970
(Sheldon:)I'll pause here
while you mull that one over.

13
00:00:28,774 --> 00:00:30,974
(Sheldon:)I know, right?

14
00:00:34,646 --> 00:00:37,846
(Penny:)So, you said you had
something to tell me.

15
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,220
(Leonard:)Okay, yeah, um,

16
00:00:39,218 --> 00:00:40,988
(Leonard:)do you remember
when you accused me

17
00:00:40,986 --> 00:00:42,856
(Leonard:)of trying to sabotage
our wedding?

18
00:00:42,855 --> 00:00:44,885
(Penny:)Uh-huh.

19
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:47,820
(Leonard:)I've been thinking about it,
and you might be right.

20
00:00:49,361 --> 00:00:53,331
(Leonard:)But the good news is
that I'm pretty sure I know why.

21
00:00:53,332 --> 00:00:55,232
(Penny:)I'm listening.

22
00:00:56,035 --> 00:00:57,835
(Leonard:)Penny, after all these years,

23
00:00:57,836 --> 00:01:01,026
(Leonard:)I still feel like
maybe I don't deserve you.

